From 5defb86e6ba027a3920e58468943914a0024380e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 02:50:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 35/43] perf(msm): run native Stage 6b batched adds on the IFMA
 drain

recursive_affine_bucket_reduce_strided's indexed batch adds gather (src, dst) operands into
the IFMA drain queue and scatter the sums back to the dst column slots, one inversion per
256 pairs. The drain now takes an output sink so Stage 6a and 6b share the kernel.

Same sums, so MSM results and proofs are unchanged.
